msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: wirecore-rest-control.php
msgid "Disables the WordPress REST API selectively – globally, per namespace or per route, including routes of other plugins."
msgstr "Sperrt die WordPress REST API gezielt – global, pro Namespace oder pro Route, auch für Routen anderer Plugins."

